sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Vaggelis
  participant C as Client<br/>(edit song form)
  participant SA as Server Action<br/>(Node runtime · secret key)
  participant ST as Supabase Storage<br/>(audio bucket)
  participant DB as Postgres (songs, edits)

  U->>C: Drop MP3 onto dropzone
  C->>C: Validate MIME + size (≤15 MB)
  C->>SA: createSignedAudioUpload({ song_id, size, type })<br/>(NOT filename)
  SA->>SA: requireRole('admin') + assertSameOrigin(headers())
  SA->>DB: SELECT r.code, s.code FROM songs s<br/>JOIN regions r ON ... WHERE s.id = $song_id
  DB-->>SA: { region_code, song_code }
  SA->>SA: path = region_code + '/' + song_code + '.' + ext
  SA->>ST: storage.createSignedUploadUrl(path) [secret key]
  ST-->>SA: { signedUrl, token }
  SA-->>C: { signedUrl, path }
  C->>ST: PUT signedUrl (file bytes)
  ST-->>C: 200 OK
  C->>SA: attachAudioToSong({ song_id, path })
  SA->>SA: requireRole + verify path matches signed path (replay guard)
  SA->>DB: UPDATE songs SET audio_path=$1, version=version+1,<br/>updated_at=now() WHERE id=$2 AND version=$expected
  DB-->>SA: ok
  SA->>DB: INSERT INTO edits(actor, action, entity_type, entity_id,<br/>diff, ip_hash, user_agent, ...)
  DB-->>SA: ok
  SA->>SA: updateTag('song:'+code) + revalidateTag('geo:songs','max')
  SA-->>C: success
  C-->>U: show player preview

  Note over SA,ST: Secret key NEVER leaves the server.<br/>Client never chooses path.
